# LsCauchy

- _LsCauchy(mean, spread, length, r)_

Random values that follow a Cauchy distribution.

Random variate folling Cauchy distribution:

~~~spl svg=A
let r = Sfc32(280142);
LsCauchy(0, 1 / 9, 99, r)
.upToEnd
.linePlot
~~~

![](Help/Image/LsCauchy-A.svg)

